  "description": "This rig uses Jovian-inspired interfaced to connect Gallente and Minmatar synchronizers. It improves projectile turrets, signature radius, and warp speed. However, as its builders do not fully understand the technology they used, it also reduces the integrity of the ship's shields, armor, and structure. It also integrates the pathways between Domination technology. This unlocks even greater performance the more Domination modules are installed.\n\nPenalty: Using more than one type of this module or similar modules that affect the same attribute on the ship will be penalized.\n\nThe CPU drawbacks of fitting this rig may be reduced by training the <a href=showinfo:96100>Synchronization Rigging</a> skill.",
